        "TileImage": "$($repository 0771273c-2ea6-4d2b-a636-409925f626c9).Image",
        "Description": "The bright lights of the Miami Grand Prix conceal darker motives. Sierra Knox — heiress to the Kronstadt empire and racing prodigy — is no stranger to scandal. But her reckless ambition has drawn dangerous attention. Enter Moses Lee, rival racer and unlikely ally turned liability. Rumors swirl of backroom deals and deadly secrets exchanged in pit lane.\r\rYour mission is simple: silence the speed demons before they leave the track for good. Time it right. Make it clean. And remember — in this race",
